OL,3,GNEWSASheep stolen then butchered in
OL,4,Awoods, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of sheep taken from a field
OL,7,Fwere found in "butchered" in nearby
OL,8,Fwoods, police have said.
OL,10,FThe creatures were believed to have
OL,11,Fdisappeared from the field adjacent to
OL,12,Fthe A57 on Manchester Road in Hollow
OL,13,FMeadows, Sheffield, overnight between 6
OL,14,Fand 7 November, South Yorkshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThey were then taken to the nearby
OL,18,FRivelin Lodge Woods, where they were
OL,19,Fkilled and cut up using "professional
OL,20,Fmethods" with offal, skins and limbs
OL,21,Fleft behind.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
