OL,3,GNEWSASheep stolen then butchered in
OL,4,Awoods, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is believed that the act would have
OL,7,Ftaken more than one offender and
OL,8,Finvolved those with knowledge to
OL,9,Fslaughter an animal," a police
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
